{"id":"vod_sn_149795","vodId":"149795","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"LV999的村民","name_cn":"LV999的村民","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20260702-1/f7de38cf7132a75f2f3a6940bfa65a32.jpg"},"summary":"剑与魔法的世界——艾斯克里亚。在这个世界里，人们生来就背负着等级与既定使命。战士、格斗家、僧侣、魔法师、盗贼、商人、猎人、咒术师、国王、贤者、勇者。而其中数量最多、毫无力量、最弱小的角色……“村民”。某日，一对村民父子遭遇魔物袭击。当那位青年飒爽登场，轻松击倒怪物时，那对父子惊得目瞪口呆。“镜浩二、村民……等级……999！？”达到 LV999 的极致境界，反抗既定命运的村民——镜浩二。魔族之巅的魔王之女——爱丽丝。两人相遇后，与伙伴们共同追寻魔族与人类共存的理想。在这个被命运赋予“对立”的世界里等待着他们的，将是这个世界不为人知的法则。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-10 10:48:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/02/ANpLwYqJKL27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/02/mgmBNRq8L527/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202607/09/1ZGVDgqZuq27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202607/09/1ZGVDgqZuq27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/23/U4DsXbHMFA27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/30/c0nS89gh1d27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/06/byYJCvV7K427/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/13/s7MCdxbgHg27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/20/iLNiMKSuXA27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/27/6Rw7Jmz18d27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202609/03/vgKfJ940aK27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202609/10/2KJLPr0WbD27/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:36.349Z"}